{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026年國際足協東盟挑戰盃（決賽）今晚傍晚喺啟德主場館上演，香港隊以2:0擊敗柬埔寨。上半場41分鐘，安永佳接應孫銘謙嘅傳球，先開紀錄，半場領先1:0。下半場54分鐘，陳肇鈞喺禁區內被踢跌，球證判罰12碼，艾華頓主射入網，港隊將比數拉開，領先2:0。下半場補時6分鐘，雙方再無入波，香港隊擊敗柬埔寨，奪得「國際足協東盟盃」D2級別冠軍。現場有逾31,000名球迷入場。國際足協會長恩芬天奴、文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩等人到場觀戰。</p>\n<p></p>\n\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-09-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-07-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-04-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-14-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-17-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-19-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-21-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-23-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" sr